  "question": {
    "text": "The relation between root mean square speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>rms</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub></mfenced></math> and most probable speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfenced></math> for the molar mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> of oxygen gas molecule at the temperature of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> will be&nbsp;"
  },
